@demographics
go-to: menu
set-bg: img/1932.jpg
face-image: img/bundrally.jpg

**Demographic Groups**

**Working Class**: The urban working class - blue-collar workers in factories, workshops, mines, and the like. Most are <span style="color: #DA291C;">**Socialist**</span>, supporting either the <span style="color: #ED1B34;">**RSDRP**</span> or other <span style="color: #ff0000;">**Left**</span>-wing parties. They make up 30-35% of the population.

**Bourgeoisie**: The Bourgeoisie consists of independent artisans, shopkeepers, and small-time businesspeople. They tend to be <span style="color: #004090;">**Conservative**</span> and are the strongest base for the nationalist parties. 10-15% of the population.

**Intelligensia**: The educated middle class consists of white-collar workers and government employees. This is the base of <span style="color: #0087dc;">**Liberalism**</span>. 10% of the population.

**Peasantry**: Small and large farmers and independent rural workers. The Peasants often support the <span style="color: #b4121a;">**PSR**</span> or, to a lesser extent, the <span style="color: #004090;">**VS**</span>. ~40% of the population.

**Muslims** are the largest minority, at about 11% or 12% of the population. They disproportionately support the <span style="color: #3bb9ff;">**Müsavat Party**</span>.

**Jews** account for between 4% to 5% of the population, and tend to support <span style="color: #DA291C;">**Socialist**</span> parties, mostly the <span style="color: #DA291C;">**RSDRP**</span>, although substantial numbers support the <span style="color: #0087dc;">**Liberal**</span>-minded <span style="color: #5566cc;">**Folkspartei**</span>.


